jdItuGb8U5I3gE-JA2HNe9T8", "expire_date": "2026-06-05T16:42:42.599Z"}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Sony WH-1000XM4", "description": "The Sony WH-1000XM4 is one of the best wireless headphones, known for its top-class noise cancellation and premium sound quality. It uses SonyÆs HD Noise Cancelling Processor to block outside noise effectively, making it perfect for travel, studying, or office use. With features like 30-hour battery life, touch controls, multipoint connection (connect two devices), and adaptive sound control, it delivers a smooth and smart listening experience. The 40 mm drivers and LDAC support ensure rich, detailed audio with deep bass and clear vocals.", "price": "18600.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_WH-1000XM4_wireless_Bluetooth_noise-canceling_headphones_vbWPSqW.jpg", "category": 2, "quantity": 29}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "Sony RX100", "description": "The Sony RX100 is a premium compact camera known for delivering DSLR-like image quality in a small, pocket-sized body. It features a large 1-inch sensor, sharp ZEISS zoom lens, fast autofocus, and excellent low-light performance, making it ideal for travel, vlogging, and everyday photography. Advanced models like the RX100 VII also support 4K video recording, real-time tracking autofocus, and high-speed shooting, making it a powerful choice for both beginners and professionals.", "price": "86000.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_RX100_gz9QBQE.jpg", "category": 1, "quantity": 7}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 4, "fields": {"name": "Sony ZV-E10", "description": "The Sony ZV-E10 is a lightweight mirrorless camera specially made for vloggers and content creators. It features a 24.2MP APS-C sensor, excellent autofocus with real-time eye tracking, and high-quality 4K video recording. Its flip-out screen, built-in microphone, and easy background blur button make it perfect for YouTube videos, travel vlogs, and social media content, while still delivering strong photo performance.", "price": "72000.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_Alpha_ZV_E10___Compact_yet_capable_D3ZtRfo.jpg", "category": 1, "quantity": 5}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 5, "fields": {"name": "Sony MDR-ZX100", "description": "The Sony MDR-ZX100 is a classic, old-school wired headphone with a very simple and lightweight design. It uses 30 mm drivers to deliver clear, balanced sound with decent bass, making it suitable for casual music listening. These headphones have a foldable, portable build and rely on a 3.5 mm jack, giving that true vintage feel without modern features like Bluetooth or noise cancellation. ItÆs a nostalgic choice for people who prefer basic, reliable audio gear over advanced tech.", "price": "2000.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_MDR-010_On-Ear_Headphones_7vCMvAY.jpg", "category": 2, "quantity": 9}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 6, "fields": {"name": "Sony WH-1000XM6", "description": "These headphones are known for their excellent Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), powerful 30mm drivers, and premium sound quality with LDAC and Hi-Res Audio support. Sony has improved the design with a foldable hinge, softer ear cushions, and better microphone quality for calls. The WH-1000XM6 also offers up to 40 hours of battery life, Bluetooth 5.3, fast charging, and smart features like adaptive sound control and multi-device connection, making it one of the best premium headphones for music, travel, gaming, and daily use.", "price": "37900.00", "image": "product_images/Upgrade_Your_Sound_Game_with_Sony_WH-1000XM6.jpg", "category": 2, "quantity": 20}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 7, "fields": {"name": "Sony WH-CH520", "description": "The WH-CH520 is popular for its lightweight design, comfortable fit, and impressive battery life of up to 50 hours. It features Bluetooth 5.2, multipoint connectivity, built-in microphone support for calls, and SonyÆs DSEE audio enhancement for clearer music quality. These headphones are great for students, casual music listening, online classes, movies, and everyday use. However, it does not include Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), so itÆs better suited for quieter environments", "price": "3489.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_WH-CH520_Wireless_Headphones__Powerful_Sound__Long_Battery.jpg", "category": 2, "quantity": 16}}, {"model": "adminapp.product", "pk": 8, "fields": {"name": "Sony RX1R III", "description": "It features a massive 61-megapixel full-frame Exmor R CMOS sensor, SonyÆs powerful BIONZ XR processor, and a built-in ZEISS Sonnar T* 35mm F2 lens for extremely sharp photos with beautiful background blur. The camera also includes AI-powered autofocus, 693 phase-detection AF points, 4K video recording, and advanced subject tracking for humans, animals, birds, and vehicles. Despite its professional-level hardware, the RX1R III remains very compact and lightweight at about 498g, making it ideal for travel, street photography, and everyday carry.", "price": "444668.00", "image": "product_images/Sony_RX1R_III_Features_61MP_Full-Frame_Sensor_Fixed_35mm_F2_Lens_Fixed_2__ZJoG2Ez.jpg", "category": 1, "quantity": 85}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 1, "fields": {"username": "admin", "password": "admin", "role": "Admin", "status": "confirm"}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 2, "fields": {"username": "abhi", "password": "abhi", "role": "Customer", "status": "confirmed"}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 3, "fields": {"username": "jaison67", "password": "12345", "role": "Customer", "status": "confirmed"}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 4, "fields": {"username": "545", "password": "HGFGHF", "role": "Customer", "status": "confirmed"}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 5, "fields": {"username": "aswathy", "password": "aswathy", "role": "Customer", "status": "confirmed"}}, {"model": "adminapp.user", "pk": 6, "fields": {"username": "allu1", "password": "allu123", "role": "DeliveryBoy", "status": "confirmed"}}, {"model": "ad